					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-1714644#post-2511744</guid>
				<title>Re: As a Brit...</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-1714644/spc-169-j#post-2511744</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Fri, 20 May 2016 06:06:23 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>MrWrong</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>2039383</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>SPC is a site in-joke. Recall how we use the initials &quot;SCP&quot;? Sometimes, someone made the mistake of typing &quot;SPC&quot; instead, which was jokingly interpreted as &quot;Shark Punching Center&quot;. And the rest is site history&#8230;</p> <p>Here is an entire list of similar articles in the site, revolving the Shark Punching Center: <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/system:page-tags/tag/shark-punching-center#pages">http://www.scp-wiki.net/system:page-tags/tag/shark-punching-center#pages</a></p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-1714644#post-2511737</guid>
				<title>As a Brit...</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-1714644/spc-169-j#post-2511737</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Fri, 20 May 2016 05:50:27 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>penfolduk01</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>2353017</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>What's this thing with &quot;shark punching&quot;?<br /> And why is the basic concept of punching a shark funny?</p> <p>Please note, this is a query about the real world origins of the term, and not a criticism of the SCP entry. Which appears to have been well thought out.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
